The demo project expects four files in this folder, kept out of git because they
are large and their rights belong to their owner:

  input-clip-example.mp4   a video clip
  model-drop-MV.mp4        a longer video with audio
  a-sample.wav             an audio sample
  effect-example-image.jpg a still used for effect thumbnails

Drop your own files with these names, or point FORMCUT_DEMO_DIR at a folder that
has them. Without them the demo button reports what is missing and effect
thumbnails fall back to a generated image.
